---
title: "Mighty Mini Mustang"
---

::: {.callout-tip}
## Initial user specifications

1. **Wing span**: 622 mm (24.5 in), per plan.
2. **Wing area**: 115 in2 (7.42 dm2), per plan.
3. **Length**: 482 mm (19 in), per plan.
4. **CG**: 25 mm aft of wing leading edge.
5. **Dry weight**: 156 g; all-up weight 222 g.
6. **Wing loading**: 29.9 g/dm2 (9.8 oz/ft2), published.
7. **Wing cubic loading**: 10.9, published.
8. **Root chord**: 133 mm, measured off full-size plan.
9. **Tip chord**: 87 mm; taper ratio 0.65, measured.
10. **Wing section**: folded 4.7 mm DTFB, flat-bottom, t/c 3.5%.
11. **Horizontal stab**: span 213 mm, area 16 in2, +/-10%.
12. **Control throws**: 12 deg all surfaces, 30% expo.
13. **Motor**: 2205 2300 kv, 6x4.5 prop.
14. **Battery**: 850 mAh 3S LiPo, 25 A ESC.
15. **Servos**: four 5 g; four channels.
16. **Vertical stab area**: not extracted; assume and declare it.
17. **Tail moment arm**: not extracted; assume and declare it.
18. **Fuselage cross-sections**: not extracted; assume and declare them.
19. **Dihedral**: gauge on plan, angle unread; assume and declare.
:::

::: {.callout-note}
## Initial assumptions

1. **Claimed top speed** 87 km/h on 3S, to verify.
2. **Claimed unlimited vertical climb**, to verify.
3. **Claimed knife-edge capability**, to verify.
4. **Claimed park-field slow flight**, to verify.
:::



